 juniper:{district:'Mercy concourse',contact:'Ada Mercer',role:'Cooperative dispatcher',rumor:'The clinic transport is not the only ship that broke formation. Ask at Hush when you are ready.',flavor:'Welders flash beyond the berth glass. A kettle whistles somewhere in the freight office.',food:'Galley stew',stock:'Grain and medical freight'},
 bellwether:{district:'Reedwater promenade',contact:'Dr. Vale',role:'Clinic coordinator',rumor:'Medicine sells cheap here because the ocean clinics make it. It fetches more at Saffron.',flavor:'Rain rolls across the world below. The promenade smells of tea and clean saltwater.',food:'Reedwater tea',stock:'Medicine and passenger work'},
 cinder:{district:'Kiln Nine shift floor',contact:'Union steward Pell',role:'Mining cooperative',rumor:'Boone Hale is looking for a ship with a captain who does not abandon an escort.',flavor:'Shift bells echo through steel ribs. A freighter is being patched with its crew still asleep inside.',food:'Night-shift noodles',stock:'Ore and machine parts'},
 hush:{district:'The relay canteen',contact:'Keeper Osei',role:'Relay caretaker',rumor:'Rook can stretch a patrol scan long enough to buy you a way out. Find them by the array.',flavor:'Half the lights are out. Every cup is tied to a table. Nobody sits with their back to the airlock.',food:'Relay coffee',stock:'Relics and recorder work'},
 crown:{district:'Directorate arrivals hall',contact:'Clerk Arden',role:'Registry office',rumor:'Meridian tracks every transponder through the gate. Settle an outstanding registry before you go.',flavor:'Polished floors. Quiet voices. A camera above every door, and a queue that never quite ends.',food:'Inner-world coffee',stock:'Machinery and licensed trade'},
